<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login - SIESELON</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,255,255,0.22), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #2563eb 55%, #4f46e5 100%);
    }
    .login-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 980px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
      border-radius: 22px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 80px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.28);
    }
    .brand-panel {
      padding: 48px;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .brand-panel::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 260px;
      height: 260px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      right: -80px;
      bottom: -80px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }
    .logo {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    .brand-panel h1 { font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .brand-panel h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 18px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .brand-panel p { line-height: 1.7; opacity: 0.92; }
    .form-panel { padding: 48px 42px; }
    .form-panel h3 { font-size: 26px; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .subtitle { color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .alert { padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 14px; }
    .alert-error { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
    .alert-success { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    label { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #374151; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
    input[type="text"], input[type="password"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    }
    input[type="text"]:focus, input[type="password"]:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #2563eb;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37,99,235,0.12);
    }
    .btn-login {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #2563eb 100%);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-login:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(37,99,235,0.25); }
    .help-box {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .help-box strong { color: #111827; }
    .footer { margin-top: 22px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; }
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .login-wrapper { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .brand-panel { padding: 34px; }
      .form-panel { padding: 34px; }
      .brand-panel h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-wrapper">
    <section class="brand-panel">
      <div class="logo">⚙️</div>
      <h1>SIESELON</h1>
      <h2>Sistem Informasi Evaluasi Sinergitas Kinerja dan Laporan Kecamatan</h2>
      <p>Kabupaten Sumedang - Tahun Anggaran 2025. Silakan masuk menggunakan akun kecamatan masing-masing untuk melakukan pengisian instrumen evaluasi.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="form-panel">
      <h3>🔐 Login</h3>
      <p class="subtitle">Masuk ke aplikasi SIESELON Kabupaten Sumedang.</p>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-error">⚠️ <%= error %></div>
      <% } %>

      <% if (success) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-success">✅ <%= success %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form action="/login" method="POST">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="username">Username</label>
          <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="Masukkan username" required autofocus>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="password">Password</label>
          <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Masukkan password" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-login">🔑 Masuk</button>
      </form>

      <div class="help-box">
        <strong>Bantuan Login Kecamatan</strong><br>
        Username kecamatan menggunakan nama kecamatan huruf kecil tanpa spasi.<br>
        Password awal kecamatan mengikuti format: <strong>username + 123</strong>.<br>
        Contoh: Kecamatan Wado → username <strong>wado</strong>, password <strong>wado123</strong>.
      </div>

      <div class="footer">&copy; 2025 Pemerintah Kabupaten Sumedang</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
